# <type>(<scope>): <short summary>
# |<----  Using a Maximum Of 72 Characters  ---->|

# Explain why this change is made (not only what).
# Wrap at 72 characters.

# --- Types (Conventional Commits) ---
# feat     — new feature
# fix      — bug fix
# refactor — code change without feature/fix
# docs     — documentation only
# style    — formatting, no logic change
# test     — add or update tests
# chore    — tooling, deps, CI
# perf     — performance improvement
# ci       — CI/CD changes
# build    — build system / external deps

# --- Scopes (examples) ---
# core, design-system, auth, ai-interview, mock-interview,
# dashboard, notifications, profile, router, network, storage

# --- Footer ---
# BREAKING CHANGE: describe migration steps
# Closes #123

# Example:
# feat(ai-interview): add session result screen scaffold
